{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/Bonebreaker.gif?t=1749252879\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the Skeleton Monk, a skillful martial artist and powerful Elemental mage. After a betrayal led to your death and the capture of your lover, you find yourself reawakened from the grave months later. With no leads and a burning desire for revenge, you set out to discover the fate of your lover and hunt down your killer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/Dodge.gif?t=1749252879\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Dark, Eastern Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Mortis, a land of imbalance ruled by the tyrannical Baron. Use your prowess to bring balance to the land and usurp the throne of it's strangling ruler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master Impactful Martial Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize your hand-to-hand combat skills and Elemental powers to engage in a unique blend of melee and magic combat. Master a dodge-focused combat system and retaliate with burning precision</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is Life?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover your skeletal nature and the fate of your captured lover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/extras/Forest.gif?t=1749252879\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2890660?t=1749252879","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749252879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749252879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890660/capsule_184x69.jp